            <ArticleTitle>Complete Genome Sequence of the Dairy Isolate Lactobacillus acidipiscis ACA-DC 1533.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01533-16</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01533-16</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Lactobacillus acidipiscis is a Gram-positive lactic acid bacterium belonging to the Lactobacillus salivarius clade. Here, we present the first complete genome sequence of L. acidipiscis isolated from traditional Greek Kopanisti cheese. Strain ACA-DC 1533 may play a key role in the strong organoleptic characteristics of Kopanisti cheese.</AbstractText>
